From: Julian Decker <git@deckerjulian.com>
Subject: rtc: rk808: list the rk808-rtc cell

The RK808 MFD adds a cell named "rk808-rtc", and the probe handles
RK808_ID, but with an id table the platform bus matches on the table only,
and the table did not have this name. An RK808 board was left without an
RTC.

---
--- a/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c
+++ b/drivers/rtc/rtc-rk808.c
@@ -485,6 +485,7 @@
 
 static const struct platform_device_id rk8xx_rtc_id_table[] = {
 	{ "rk805-rtc", 0 },
+	{ "rk808-rtc", 0 },
 	{ "rk809-rtc", 0 },
 	{ "rk816-rtc", 0 },
 	{ "rk817-rtc", 0 },
